{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 In the game, the player will play the role of the &quot;Tester&quot; who travels from reality to the &quot;Land of Evolution&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each game, players will have to pass six levels and defeat the final BOSS to win and become the &quot;God of Evolution&quot; candidate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Traditional overhead barrage shooting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 15 side quests are randomly generated, and each round has a different experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 40 hot-swappable chips turn the skill mechanism on its head</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Match 20 bloodlines with you,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Currently only support Chinese, English support will be introduced in the future</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overhead corner barrage play:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565840/extras/sk1.png?t=1745254551\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pedigree matching:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565840/extras/bl1.png?t=1745254551\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can build their own BD by matching different bloodlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Magical chemical reactions can occur between different bloodlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All of the same bloodline can trigger the ultimate evolution of a pure blood bloodline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Different lineages can also induce the mutation and evolution of lineages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill system:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565840/extras/sk2.png?t=1745254551\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 All skills can be inserted into the chip to change their skill form</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Skill trajectories, attributes, and ballistic attributes can be freely matched</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565840?t=1745254551","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565840/760c8255f274447ccc4973608af7e4fdefc51461/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745254551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565840/b8313b590aedc2d60c3893e6e65131382310c59d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745254551","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565840/b8313b590aedc2d60c3893e6e65131382310c59d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745254551","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 In the game, the player will play the role of the &quot;Tester&quot; who travels from reality to the &quot;Land of Evolution&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each game, players will have to pass six levels and defeat the final BOSS to win and become the &quot;God of Evolution&quot; candidate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Traditional overhead barrage shooting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 15 side quests are randomly generated, and each round has a different experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 40 hot-swappable chips turn the skill mechanism on its head</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Match 20 bloodlines with you,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Curren